Output docs/media/conflicts.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1640
Set Height 820
Set Padding 14
Set Margin 22
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 36
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 24
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Env GITPAD_LOGO text
Hide
Type 'cd "$GITPAD_CONFLICT" && clear && gitpad' Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Type "x"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 900ms
Type "b"
Sleep 900ms
Screenshot docs/screenshots/conflicts.png
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+S
Sleep 1.8s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
